<?xml version="1.0"?>
<body language="English">
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00000" index="0">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Magnus: Oh, GOSH!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00001" index="1">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You...!\nIt deadass IS you, {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\rOUTSTANDIN’!\nYou made it ALL the way up here, bud!\fI’m cryin’ again. It’s allergies.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00002" index="2">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">This the “Friendship” room.\rIt was built to honor the\nbond, trust, and potential\fof homies and people and\fto hope for eternal friendship\fbetween homies and people.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00003" index="3">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">CONGRATS!\rThis room is only for TRUE\nPokéathletes with real friendships\fwith their homies!\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou a true Pokéathlete, bud!\fI’m gon’ hug you. Bracin’ for impact.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00004" index="4">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That bein’ said...\nthis is also the moment of a new\fbeginnin’...\fI practiced this speech in the mirror.\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00005" index="5">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">That’s right, bud!\nYou just heard a new startin’\fsignal. Your challenge keep goin’\fto whole new heights and to becomin’\fthe legendary Pokéathlete!\rTake a look at this statue.\nYou might be lookin’ at your goal...\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00006" index="6">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">Magnus: This the “Friendship” room.\nIt’s the last one. It’s the room\fwhere eternal friendship between\fpeople and homies get sworn.\r...But this ain’t your goal, bud.\rEvery room got Trophies to earn,\nbut you can aim for any new height.\rIt’s all on you whether\nyou get there or not...\rThat’s right!\rYour true goal ain’t somethin’\nnobody else can decide for you, bud.\r{STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}!\nYou can get past ANYTHING\fwith your bond with your homies.</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00007" index="7">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s your statue!\r</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00008" index="8">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">The statue of the homie\nyou rode this whole journey\fwith, helpin’ each other and\fbuildin’ your bond!</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00009" index="9">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s the statue of a Medalist homie.\rYou wanna swap it with another?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00010" index="10">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can put up a statue of a\nMedalist homie that\fearned five medals.\rYou wanna put up a statue?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00011" index="11">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s the statue of a Medalist homie.\rYou wanna swap it with another?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00012" index="12">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">You can put up a statue of a\nMedalist homie that\fearned five medals.\rYou wanna put up a statue?</language>
	</row>
	<row id="msg_0143_D49R0107_00013" index="13">
		<attribute name="window_context_name">used</attribute>
		<language name="English">It’s the statue of a Medalist homie.\rYou wanna swap it with another?</language>
	</row>
</body>
